11344::$$$message_0090_0000_0000$$$::I hear some rumor at the street corner.[lr]::
11345::$$$message_0090_0000_0001$$$::Shinto's suburbs. That there is a mansion, that no one knows who built it, in the deep forest past the church.[lr]::
11346::$$$message_0090_0000_0002$$$::The rumor spreads quickly, and apparently there were some who were actually trying to find the mansion.::
11347::$$$message_0090_0001_0000$$$::"...There really are some curious people. Like whoever started the rumor and the ones who actually went to go find the mansion."[lr]::
11348::$$$message_0090_0001_0001$$$::And there's another curious person here.[lr]::
11349::$$$message_0090_0001_0002$$$::Geez, there's other things to do.::
11350::$$$message_0090_0002_0000$$$::"Oh my god, only took one try."[lr]::
11351::$$$message_0090_0002_0001$$$::I easily found the rumored haunted mansion.[lr]::
11352::$$$message_0090_0002_0002$$$::I couldn't hear why it was called a haunted mansion.::
11353::$$$message_0090_0003_0000$$$::I don't have any business here.[lr]::
11354::$$$message_0090_0003_0001$$$::There probably isn't anything inside and I would be trespassing.[lr]::
11355::$$$message_0090_0003_0002$$$::I...::
911344::$$$message_9090_0000_0000$$$::I hear some rumor at the street corner.[r]::

